{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "69d0678d-5d39-8639-9b37-ad88c3355656",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T10:19:37-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning, hon. Yeah, I got a buried hydrant I wanna report. Right out front of where I live, 42 Broadway, up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a buried hydrant at 42 Broadway. Let me get that down. Is it buried in snow, or is it something else, like plow piles?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Snow. We only got a dusting the last day or so, but the plow came through before that and threw a bank up along the curb, and then it froze solid. It's been so cold, hon, it's like a rock now. You can see just the little top cap poking out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:14:37-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the hydrant is mostly covered by a frozen bank from the plowing, with just the top showing. Is it on the same side of the street as your building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:14:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same side, yeah. Right at the curb, in front of the house, maybe ten feet from the walkway. Number 42, the gray one with the green door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gray house, green door, hydrant at the curb about ten feet from the walkway. And you said it's frozen hard, so it's not something a shovel will get through easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No way. I tried with a shovel this morning and it just bounced off. You'd need a pickaxe or the machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put that in the log so the crew knows it's packed hard. Can I have your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Singh. S-I-N-G-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:16:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Singh. And a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0183. That's the landline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0183. Let me read it all back. Tariq Singh, 42 Broadway, hydrant at the curb in front of the gray house, buried under a frozen plow bank with only the cap showing. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:16:40-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, perfect. And can you make sure it actually gets logged, hon? Because I think somebody else mentioned it a while back and nothing happened. I don't know, maybe they didn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:17:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's going in right now, under your name and address, with today's date. I can't tell you the exact day the crew gets there, they work through the list, but it'll be on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, that's all I want. I just don't want the fire department showing up and not finding it. Plenty of old buildings on this block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, hydrants are a priority for clearing. Is the sidewalk in front of it passable at least, or is that blocked too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:17:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sidewalk's okay, I cleared it. It's just the hydrant. Oh, and the corner, there's a little ridge there, but people get over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note the ridge at the corner too, but the main concern is the hydrant. Anything else about the street itself, like the plowing being missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:18:24-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, street's been plowed fine. Just the hydrant. Well, and my downstairs neighbor plays the radio loud in the afternoons, but that's not you guys, that's somebody else, I know. Forget I said it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that one would be a different office, probably the landlord or the police non-emergency line if it gets bad. I'll stick to the hydrant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. Anyway, that's the hydrant. You got everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:19:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Hydrant at 42 Broadway, frozen plow bank, logged this morning, callback to 401-555-0183 if the crew needs more detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks, hon. You have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:19:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Singh. Stay warm, and thanks for calling it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T10:19:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
